flowchart TD
    User([👤 User]) --> UI[🎯 User Interface<br/>CLI/Web Chat]
    UI --> CA[🤖 Chat Agent<br/>Conversational Memory]
    CA --> RAG[🧠 RAG Engine<br/>Hybrid Retrieval]
    RAG --> VS[🔍 Vector Store<br/>Semantic Search<br/>FAISS + Embeddings]
    RAG --> KB[📚 Knowledge Base<br/>Music Domain Facts<br/>Genre/Mood Context]
    RAG --> TR[📊 Traditional Recommender<br/>Hybrid Scoring<br/>Content-based Filtering]
    VS --> LLM[💬 LLM Generation<br/>OpenAI GPT<br/>Contextual Responses]
    KB --> LLM
    TR --> LLM
    RAG --> PG[🎵 Playlist Generator<br/>Mood-based Playlists<br/>Energy Flow]
    RAG --> TA[📈 Taste Analyzer<br/>User Preferences<br/>Profile Analysis]
    LLM --> Response[💭 Personalized Response<br/>With Explanations]
    PG --> Response
    TA --> Response
    Response --> UI
    Response --> Logs[(📝 System Logs<br/>Activity Tracking)]
    Tester[🧪 Tester/Developer] --> Demo[🚀 Demo Scripts<br/>Feature Testing]
    Demo --> CA
    Demo --> Validation[✅ Validation<br/>Error Handling<br/>Fallbacks]
    Songs[(🎼 Song Database<br/>CSV/Embeddings)] --> VS
    Songs --> TR
    Knowledge[(🧠 Music Knowledge<br/>Domain Facts)] --> KB
